"description":"PERSONALIZED MUSIC TO HELP YOU FOCUS\nBased on science and inspired by video games, Vibes creates personalized music designed to improve focus, intensity, and concentration. \n\nSMARTER FOCUS MUSIC\nVibes knows your wake and sleep times and generates background music based on your activity throughout the day to help you wake up, focus at work, relax, and sleep deeper.\n\nJUST ONE TAP\nIt's the world’s easiest app to use. One tap to open and automatically play exactly what music you need for the moment.\n\nCONTROL WHEN YOU NEED IT\nSet your energy level and give yourself a boost when you need it or adjust presence to push soundscapes into the background for deeper focus.\n\nIMMERSIVE SPATIAL AUDIO\nSpatial 3D soundscapes that come alive around you with support for realtime head tracking.\n\nWIDGETS\nEasy one-tap access to your most used vibes.\n\nSET A TIMER\nSet a timer for focus sessions or to fall asleep.\n\nUNLOCK ACHIEVEMENTS\nInspired by video games to make daily life more fun. Unlock spirits.\n\nPRAISE FOR (NOT BORING) APPS\n\"Astonishingly fun!\"—John Gruber\n2x Apple Design Awards\n6x App of the Day\nFast Company Innovation by Design\n\nSUPER!BORING\nBecome a Super!Boring member and get all 5 Not Boring apps + skins + extras. We are 100% member-supported. No ads, no data gathering, no tracking. Just beautiful apps that make everyday life a little less boring.\n\nPlans: https://andy.works/plans\nSupport: https://andy.works/support\nEULA/Terms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/", "bundleId":"com.andyworks.vibes", "sellerUrl":"https://www.andy.works", "averageUserRating":4.849560000000000314912540488876402378082275390625, "trackCensoredName":"(Not Boring) Vibes", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN", "FR", "DE", "IT", "JA", "KO", "ZH", "ES", "ZH"], "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.849560000000000314912540488876402378082275390625, "fileSizeBytes":"321468416", "formattedPrice":"Free", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+",